        "TileImage": "$($repository 8b0a081a-170a-4a62-a35a-8434279e1509).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rICA agents Michele &quot;The Cook&quot; Finversini and Padre &quot;The Pistoleer&quot; Francesco and others have gone into hiding in the town of Sapienza. You are to eliminate them both as I believe they have intel on other ICA agents in hiding. In order to send the message that you, 47, are after them, keep your suit on. Also, try to keep the death count to a minimum.\r\rGood luck, 47",
